# Files whose exact BYTES are part of the record must never be line-ending
# translated. Git's autocrlf would rewrite LF as CRLF in a Windows working tree,
# which changes the sha256 and silently breaks a hash that exists precisely so a
# reader can verify the pre-registered split was not altered after the fact.
runs/_p3_manifest.json -text

# Committed run artifacts are evidence; keep them byte-stable too.
runs/**/*.json -text
runs/**/*.npy binary
